bell University also maintains affirmative action programs to implement our equal employment opportunity policy. Employees or applicants who wish to review appropriate portions of these affirmative action programs may schedule an appointment to do so by contacting Human Resources at the Buies Creek campus, during normal business hours. Back Share Apply Now Campbell University Human Resources 95 Bolton Road PO Box 595 Buies Creek, NC 27506 (910) 893-1256 Human Resources | Employment Policies"
